# DMW3 PC Edition stage data v1 (edit in-game with F2, or by hand)
# exit  x y w h TARGET [arriveX arriveY]
# npc   talk  SPRITE x y dir "Name" "Line one|Line two"
# npc   fight|boss SPRITE x y dir "Name" level
# item  sword x y
cell 8
size 160 112
spawn 300 640
exit 0 792 18 64 S400 205 862
npc talk P011MINO 330 600 0 "Mina" "Welcome to the DMW3 PC Edition demo!|Walls work now - try walking into a building.|Black Agumon waits on the boulevard. Touch it to fight!|The bridge to the south-west leads to the forest."
npc fight P171BAGM 610 482 7 "Black Agumon" 3
npc fight P167SAGM 830 600 6 "Blue Agumon" 4
npc boss P123DIGM 960 252 0 "Digmon" 8
walls
